      "ecbe0e3f-eb9b-4cb3-9d50-59bd1c0c9645"],
     "\[LineSeparator]returns the entanglement entropy between the subsystem \
consisting of fermion modes {k1, k2, \[Ellipsis]}\[Subset]{1, 2, \[Ellipsis], \
n} and the rest in the fermionic Gaussian state characterized by n\[Times]n \
matrix grn of single-particle Green's functions. "
    }],ExpressionUUID->"e3739569-31d7-4778-8b42-ebf1dc87f0c8"]},
   {"", Cell[TextData[{
     "WickEntanglementEntropy[state,",
