      FontFamily->"Source Sans Pro",ExpressionUUID->
      "9ec52239-0921-413f-9398-2f3fe1973e2b"],
     ",k2,\[Ellipsis]}]\[LineSeparator]calculates the entanglement entropy \
for the Wick ",
     Cell[BoxData[
      StyleBox["state", "TI"]], "InlineFormula",
      FontFamily->"Source Sans Pro",ExpressionUUID->
      "056fe232-1313-484b-8a1f-5b8135afd6d1"],
     " (i.e., fermionic Gaussian pure state) ws."
