...}\\[Subset]{1, 2, ..., n} and the rest in the fermionic Gaussian state \
characterized by n*n matrix grn of single-particle Green's functions. \
WickEntanglementEntropy[state,{k1,k2,...}] calculates the entanglement \
entropy for the Wick state (i.e., fermionic Gaussian pure state) ws.", 
